Zone's primary website is https://www.zone.ee/. It offers domain registration, website and email hosting, cloud and private-server services, website security and monitoring, and self-service tools. The site serves newcomers, small businesses, agencies, developers and organizations with more advanced requirements. For specific product functionality, eligibility, pricing and policies, consult the linked live pages rather than relying solely on this overview.

