## Company information

- [About Zone (Estonian)](https://www.zone.ee/et/ettevottest/): Official company background, history, mission, team, footprint and services.
- [Why Zone? (Estonian)](https://www.zone.ee/et/miks-zone/): Overview of the provider's benefits and positioning.
- [Contact details (Estonian)](https://www.zone.ee/et/kontakt/): Official business contact and company details.
- Zone was founded in Estonia in 1999 and became part of the Your.Online group in August 2026.
- According to its company page, Zone serves more than 60,000 unique customers and has a team of more than 50 specialists.
- Its infrastructure extends from the Baltics to the Benelux region; Zone expanded its operations to Finland in 2021.
- Zone develops its own hosting technology: ZoneOS powers web applications, while MinuZone provides customers with an interface for managing services.
- The company's mission is to help customers operate online in a reliable, secure and economically sensible way.
- Zone provides human customer support, with service in Estonian, English, Russian and Finnish. Check current support contact hours on the official support pages; 24/7 system monitoring is not the same as 24/7 live telephone support.

## Products and services

- [Domain registration (Estonian)](https://www.zone.ee/et/domeeni-registreerimine/): Search, register, renew and manage domains, including Estonian and international domain extensions. Domain transfer and DNS management information is also available.
- [Web hosting (Estonian)](https://www.zone.ee/et/veebimajutus/): Hosting for websites, WordPress projects, small businesses and online stores, with related domain and email services.
